# 🍳 Recipe Management REST API

A RESTful API for managing recipes, built with **Node.js**, **Express.js**, and **MongoDB (Mongoose)** using the **MVC** architecture.

🌐 **Live API:** [https://recipe-task-l8ne.onrender.com](https://recipe-task-l8ne.onrender.com)

---

## ✨ Features

- 📝 Full CRUD operations: create, read, update, and delete recipes
- 🧩 Clean MVC structure with separate models, controllers, and routes
- 🗄️ MongoDB integration using Mongoose ODM
- 🛡️ Validation and error handling with proper HTTP status codes
- 🔐 Secure configuration with environment variables via `dotenv`

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer      | Technology          |
| :--------- | :------------------ |
| Runtime    | Node.js             |
| Framework  | Express.js          |
| Database   | MongoDB, Mongoose   |
| Testing    | Postman             |
| Deployment | Render              |

---

## 📌 API Endpoints

| Method    | Endpoint           | Description            |
| :-------- | :----------------- | :--------------------- |
| `GET`     | `/api/recipes`     | Get all recipes        |
| `GET`     | `/api/recipes/:id` | Get a recipe by ID     |
| `POST`    | `/api/recipes`     | Create a new recipe    |
| `PUT`     | `/api/recipes/:id` | Update a recipe        |
| `DELETE`  | `/api/recipes/:id` | Delete a recipe        |

### 📥 Sample Request Body (POST / PUT)

```json
{
  "title": "Delicious Pasta",
  "ingredients": ["Pasta", "Tomato Sauce", "Cheese", "Garlic"],
  "instructions": "Boil pasta, sauté garlic, mix with sauce and cheese."
}
```

