---

## ⚙️ Getting Started

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/kowsalyadevivijay-cloud/recipe-task.git
cd recipe-task
```

### 2️⃣ Install dependencies

```bash
npm install
```

### 3️⃣ Configure environment variables

Create a `.env` file in the root directory:

```env
PORT=3000
MONGO_URI=your_mongodb_connection_string
```

### 4️⃣ Run the server

```bash
npm run dev   # development (nodemon)
npm start     # production
```

---

## 🧪 Testing

Import `Recipe-task.postman_collection.json` into Postman to test all endpoints with sample requests.

---

## 🚀 Deployment

Deployed on **Render**, with environment variables configured securely in the Render dashboard.

